<MafiaLayout title="Support" description="Help with Mafia for iPhone, subscriptions, restoring purchases, audio and privacy. Contact Bubble App Studio.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Mafia for iPhone</p><h1>How can we help?</h1>
  <p>Contact Bubble App Studio for help or feedback about Mafia.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button primary contact" href="mailto:contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz?subject=mafia%20ios%20app">contact@bubbleappstudio.xyz</a></div>
  <p>Please include your iPhone model, iOS version, app version and a short description of the issue. Never send your password or payment card details.</p>
  <h2>Restore Premium</h2><p>Use the same Apple Account that made the purchase, open Mafia’s subscription screen and tap <strong>Restore Purchases</strong>. An internet connection is required to check your subscription.</p>
  <h2>Manage or cancel a subscription</h2><p>On your iPhone, open <strong>Settings → your name → Subscriptions → Mafia</strong>. Deleting the app does not cancel a subscription. Prices, billing periods and any eligible trial are displayed before purchase.</p><p><a href="https://apps.apple.com/account/subscriptions">Open Apple subscription management</a></p>
  <h2>Request a refund</h2><p>Apple handles App Store payments and refund requests. Visit <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/">Apple’s Report a Problem page</a> to request a refund.</p>
  <h2>No sound?</h2><p>Turn up your media volume and check whether audio is going to Bluetooth headphones or another speaker. Restart Mafia if narration is interrupted.</p>
  <h2>Player photos and privacy</h2><p>Player names and optional photos are used locally for your game. You can play without taking a photo. See our <a href="/mafia/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details about purchases and support messages.</p>
  <h2>Terms of Use</h2><p>Mafia uses the <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/">Apple Standard End User License Agreement (EULA)</a>.</p>
</MafiaLayout>
